    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In 1886, three San Francisco businessmen—including lawyer Frank Morrison Pixley—incorporated the town, naming it after him.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://tularecountyedc.com/city/pixley/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Southern Pacific railroad made Pixley a mandatory rest stop, expanding a freight dock into a depot and a three‑story hotel.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
