        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://tularecountyedc.com/city/pixley/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The first house in Pixley was built for Emma, William Pixley’s widow, the late brother of Frank Pixley, marking the town’s early domestic life.",
